{
  "_meta": {
    "id": 46,
    "name": "dialog_loc_cre_character_creation",
    "description": "Dialogi przypisane do lokacji \"Character Creation\" (waa: cre).",
    "status": "done",
    "count": 158
  },
  "strings": {
    "\"%adventurebook_title%\".": {
      "pl": "\"%adventurebook_title%\".",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_yourbooks.firstread",
        "data.json:scripts.cre_yourbooks.read"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "\"%cre_boringbook%\"": {
      "pl": "\"%cre_boringbook%\"",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_brobookshelf.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "%adventurebook_comment%": {
      "pl": "%adventurebook_comment%",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_yourbooks.firstread",
        "data.json:scripts.cre_yourbooks.read"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "%cre_boringbookreact%": {
      "pl": "%cre_boringbookreact%",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_brobookshelf.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "(Both Gary and the dark horse will refuse to ride with you as well.)": {
      "pl": "(Gary i mroczny koń też odmówią jazdy z tobą.)",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.skip"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "(Gary will refuse to ride with you as well.)": {
      "pl": "(Gary też odmówi jazdy z tobą.)",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.skip"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "(The dark horse will refuse to ride with you as well.)": {
      "pl": "(Mroczny koń też odmówi jazdy z tobą.)",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.skip"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "??? [Not unlocked]": {
      "pl": "??? [Nie odblokowano]",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.horse",
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.pardner"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "A present?": {
      "pl": "Prezent?",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_mother.mom2",
        "data.json:scripts.cre_mother.mom3"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "All right then.  $promptvalue$ the horse.  It's got a nice ring to it.": {
      "pl": "W porządku. Koń imieniem $promptvalue$. Ładnie to brzmi.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.yesname",
        "data.json:scripts.npc_bshostler.yesname",
        "data.json:scripts.npc_bshostler.yesnewname"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Alrighty then, buckaroo! The hard road it is. Now, what horse would you like to take?": {
      "pl": "No dobra, buckaroo! Wybrałeś trudną drogę. Którego konia bierzesz?",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.horse"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Alrighty then, buckaroo! What horse would you like to take?": {
      "pl": "No dobra, buckaroo! Którego konia bierzesz?",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.horse"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Alrighty!  Automatic XP spending has been disabled.  You can change this back in the Options Menu at any time.": {
      "pl": "Ekstra! Auto-wydawanie PD jest wyłączone. Możesz to zmienić w menu Opcji w każdej chwili.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.manual"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Any horses or pardners you unlocked in any previous game will be available to you, and you'll start with @tutskip_maxmeat@ Meat and some of the more important items from Boring Springs.": {
      "pl": "Konie i towarzysze odblokowani w poprzednich grach będą dostępni. Dostaniesz @tutskip_maxmeat@ Mięsa i część ważniejszych rzeczy z Boring Springs.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.start"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Are you sure you want to name your horse $promptvalue$?": {
      "pl": "Na pewno chcesz nazwać konia $promptvalue$?",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.confirmname",
        "data.json:scripts.npc_bshostler.confirmname",
        "data.json:scripts.npc_bshostler.confirmnewname"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Bring it on [Hard Mode]": {
      "pl": "No to jedziemy [Tryb trudny]",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.skip",
        "data.json:scripts.tut_gethardhat.hardmode"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "But it's so dangerous!  60% of the people who go West get killed within a year, and that statistic is from <i>before</i> The Cows Came Home.": {
      "pl": "Ale to takie niebezpieczne! 60% osób jadących na Zachód ginie w ciągu roku — a ta statystyka jest sprzed czasów, <i>zanim</i> Krowy Wróciły do Domu.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_brother.bro3"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Caw!": {
      "pl": "Kra!",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_ravenconvo.start",
        "data.json:scripts.train_passenter6b.russ1",
        "data.json:scripts.train_passenter6b.russ2",
        "data.json:scripts.train_passenter6b.russ3"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Caw!  Caw caw!": {
      "pl": "Kra! Kra kra!",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_ravenconvo.missyou"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Choose a name for your horse": {
      "pl": "Wybierz imię dla swojego konia",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.namehorse",
        "data.json:scripts.npc_bshostler.namehorse",
        "data.json:scripts.npc_bshostler.namenewhorse"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Comb Hair": {
      "pl": "Poczesaj włosy",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_desk.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Fairly normal": {
      "pl": "Całkiem normalny",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.temperament"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Feed Russell a cricket": {
      "pl": "Daj Russellowi świerszcza",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_ravenconvo.missyou"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Finally, would you like to keep spending your XP automatically, or would you like to do it yourself?": {
      "pl": "Na koniec: wydawać PD automatycznie, czy wolisz robić to sam?",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.finish"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Give her a name": {
      "pl": "Nadaj jej imię",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.horse2",
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.horse3",
        "data.json:scripts.npc_bshostler.confirmhorse2",
        "data.json:scripts.npc_bshostler.confirmhorse3",
        "data.json:scripts.npc_bshostler.swaphorse3"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Give him a name": {
      "pl": "Nadaj mu imię",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.horse1",
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.horse4",
        "data.json:scripts.npc_bshostler.confirmhorse1",
        "data.json:scripts.npc_bshostler.confirmhorse4",
        "data.json:scripts.npc_bshostler.swaphorse1"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Give him his puzzle back": {
      "pl": "Oddaj mu układankę",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_brother.givecube",
        "data.json:scripts.cre_brother.puzz2"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Go it alone [Not recommended]": {
      "pl": "Samotnie [Nie polecane]",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.pardner"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Go to Photo Studio": {
      "pl": "Idź do studia foto",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_twilighthat.start"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Go to Trailer Zone": {
      "pl": "Idź do strefy przyczepy",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_twilighthat.start"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Go to Twilight Zone": {
      "pl": "Idź do Strefy Zmierzchu",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_twilighthat.start"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Go West, Young $man$?": {
      "pl": "Idź na zachód, młody $man$?",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_starttut.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Goblins with you can speaking?": {
      "pl": "Gobliny ze mną mogą rozmawiać?",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.language"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Good...  good luck out there.  Be sure to say goodbye to your mother.": {
      "pl": "Dobrze... powodzenia tam. Koniecznie pożegnaj się z mamą.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_dadconvo.thankyou"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Goodbye phonograph!": {
      "pl": "Pa, fonografie!",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_phonograph.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Goodbye Russell.  Be good.": {
      "pl": "Pa, Russell. Bądź grzeczny.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_ravenconvo.cricket"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Goodbye, bed.  Time to head West to chase my <i>real</i> dreams!": {
      "pl": "Pa, łóżko. Pora ruszyć na Zachód za <i>prawdziwymi</i> marzeniami!",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_yourbed.saypopup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Goodbye, desk.": {
      "pl": "Pa, biurku.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_desk.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "He's busy drawing pictures in the dust.": {
      "pl": "Ma zajęcie — rysuje obrazki na piasku.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_brother.already"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "He's got a point, you know.  Why <i>are</i> you going West, anyway?": {
      "pl": "Ma trochę racji, wiesz. Po co <i>właściwie</i> jedziesz na Zachód?",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_brother.bro2"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "He's just barely holding it together.  It's probably best for him if you just go.": {
      "pl": "Ledwo trzyma się na nogach. Chyba lepiej już po prostu iść.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_dadconvo.didalready"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Heh.  He loves stuff like this.": {
      "pl": "Heh. Uwielbia takie rzeczy.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_brotoybox.getpuz"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Hey, a needle!": {
      "pl": "Ej, igła!",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_haystack.search"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Hey, Rufus.  Time for me to head West.": {
      "pl": "Hej, Rufus. Pora ruszyć na Zachód.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_brother.bro2"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Heya Russell.  How you doin'?": {
      "pl": "Siema, Russell. Jak tam leci?",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_ravenconvo.start"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "His lip quivers a little.": {
      "pl": "Warga mu lekko drży.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_dadconvo.leaving"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "How would you describe your... sense of justice?": {
      "pl": "Jak opisałbyś swój... zmysł sprawiedliwości?",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.temperament"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "I changed my mind, I don't want to skip ahead": {
      "pl": "Jednak nie — nie chcę nic pomijać",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.horse"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "I did. Goodbye, Dad.": {
      "pl": "Już się pożegnałem. Pa, tato.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_dadconvo.thankyou"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "I do not want this": {
      "pl": "Tego nie chcę",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.skip",
        "data.json:scripts.tut_gethardhat.hardmode"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "I just wanted one more hug before I leave.": {
      "pl": "Potrzebuję jeszcze jednego przytulenia przed wyjazdem.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_mother.anotherhug",
        "data.json:scripts.cre_mother.hug2"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "I still don't understand why you're leaving.": {
      "pl": "Nadal nie rozumiem, po co wyjeżdżasz.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_brother.bro2"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "I was born ready to mosey on over there": {
      "pl": "Na to czekałem całe życie",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.realfinish"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "I will, Mom.  Goodbye.": {
      "pl": "Obiecuję, mamo. Pa.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_mother.end"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "I will. Goodbye, Dad.": {
      "pl": "Pożegnam się. Pa, tato.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_dadconvo.thankyou"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "I'll be okay.": {
      "pl": "Dam sobie radę.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_brother.bro3"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "I'll be okay.  You worry about taking care of Mom and Dad, I'll worry about me.": {
      "pl": "Dam sobie radę. Ty dbaj o mamę i tatę, a ja o siebie.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_brother.bro4"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "I'll grow into it.": {
      "pl": "Urosnę do niej.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_dadconvo.hat"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "I'll miss you, Rufus.": {
      "pl": "Będę za tobą tęsknił, Rufusie.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_brother.bro4",
        "data.json:scripts.cre_brother.bro5"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "I'm gonna miss you, buddy.": {
      "pl": "Będę za tobą tęsknił, stary.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_ravenconvo.start",
        "data.json:scripts.cre_ravenconvo.missyou"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "I'm leaving now, Mom.": {
      "pl": "Muszę już iść, mamo.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_mother.start",
        "data.json:scripts.cre_mother.mom2"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "If you put this hat on, you won't ever be able to take it off, and things will be much harder for you.": {
      "pl": "Jak założysz ten kask, nie zdejmiesz go już nigdy — i gra stanie się dużo trudniejsza.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.skip"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "It's a haystack.": {
      "pl": "To stóg siana.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_haystack.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "It's covered with all of his weird diagrams and charts.": {
      "pl": "Całe usiane jego dziwnymi schematami i wykresami.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_brodesk.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "It's our shelf full of souvenirs from old family vacations.": {
      "pl": "To nasza półka pełna pamiątek ze starych rodzinnych wyjazdów.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_souvenirshelf.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "It's time for me to leave.": {
      "pl": "Pora na mnie.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_dadconvo.hat"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "It's time to hit the trail": {
      "pl": "Pora ruszyć w drogę",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_ravenconvo.release"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "It's your kid brother's toybox.": {
      "pl": "Skrzynka na zabawki młodszego brata.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_brotoybox.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Keep spending it automatically": {
      "pl": "Wydawaj automatycznie",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.finish"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Leave Russell alone": {
      "pl": "Zostaw Russella w spokoju",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_ravenconvo.start"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Listen, I... want you to have this.  It's $heirloom$.": {
      "pl": "Słuchaj, chcę, żebyś to wziął. To $heirloom$.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_dadconvo.leaving"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Looks like this isn't your first rodeo!": {
      "pl": "Wygląda na to, że to nie twój pierwszy rodeo!",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.start"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Maybe it's time for you to leave, too...": {
      "pl": "Może i ty powinieneś stąd wylecieć...",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_ravenconvo.cricket"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "No": {
      "pl": "Nie",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.confirmname",
        "data.json:scripts.item_elv_transponder.invpopup",
        "data.json:scripts.item_elv_transponder.turnbackon",
        "data.json:scripts.item_minipiano.invpopup",
        "data.json:scripts.item_whisperstone.listen"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "No Goblintongue for you this time.": {
      "pl": "Tym razem bez Goblińszczyzny.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.temperamenttemp"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "No time to screw around in the woods. Time to head West!": {
      "pl": "Nie ma czasu na głupoty w lesie. Czas ruszać na Zachód!",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_treewall.thinkpopup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "No, I want to play the prologue again": {
      "pl": "Nie, chcę zagrać prolog jeszcze raz",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.start"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Now pick a pardner": {
      "pl": "Teraz wybierz towarzysza",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.yesname"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Oh hey, this one might come in handy.": {
      "pl": "Ej, ta może się przydać.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_yourbooks.coolbook"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Okay, looks like you're ready to mosey on over to Dirtwater!": {
      "pl": "No to wygląda na to, że możesz ruszać do Dirtwater!",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.realfinish"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Okay.  If you say so.  I still think you'll be dead by Crimbo.": {
      "pl": "Okej. Skoro tak mówisz. I tak obstawiam, że do Gwizdonek cię już nie będzie.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_brother.bro4"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Please be careful out there.  Write us a letter when you can.": {
      "pl": "Uważaj na siebie. Napisz do nas, jak będziesz mógł.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_mother.end"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Plunder those memories": {
      "pl": "Przeszperaj te wspomnienia",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_souvenirshelf.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Read another title": {
      "pl": "Przeczytaj inny tytuł",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_yourbooks.firstread",
        "data.json:scripts.cre_yourbooks.read"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Rufus, you know how much I hate it here.  I can't stay.  I've gotta go where the action is.": {
      "pl": "Rufus, wiesz, jak nienawidzę tego miejsca. Nie mogę tu zostać. Muszę jechać tam, gdzie coś się dzieje.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_brother.bro2c"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Say goodbye": {
      "pl": "Pożegnaj się",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_brother.start",
        "data.json:scripts.cre_brother.bro1a"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "She hugs you.": {
      "pl": "Przytula cię.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_mother.end"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "She smiles and hugs you again.": {
      "pl": "Uśmiecha się i znów cię przytula.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_mother.hug2"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
