      "pl": "Dziwny z niego typ",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_brother.already",
        "data.json:scripts.cre_brother.puzz3"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Welcome to the debug hat!": {
      "pl": "Witaj w kapeluszu debugowym!",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_twilighthat.start"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Well, first things first. Do you want to wear the hard hat?": {
      "pl": "Najpierw sprawa pierwsza. Zakładasz twardy kask?",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.skip"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "What a mess!": {
      "pl": "Co za syf!",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_firewood.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "What? No": {
      "pl": "Co? Nie",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.language"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Who would you like to take West with you as a pardner?": {
      "pl": "Kogo zabierasz ze sobą na Zachód jako towarzysza?",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.pardner"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Would you like to skip the Boring Springs prologue and head straight to Dirtwater?": {
      "pl": "Pominąć prolog w Boring Springs i od razu ruszyć do Dirtwater?",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.start"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Yep!  It's that book you wanted for Crimbo.  I know it's early, but...": {
      "pl": "Ta! To ta książka na Gwizdonki, o którą chodziło. Wiem, wcześnie, ale...",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_mother.mom3"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You comb your hair one last time.": {
      "pl": "Po raz ostatni czeszesz włosy.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_desk.comb"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You give him a playful punch on the arm.": {
      "pl": "Przyjaźnie klepiesz go w ramię.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_brother.bro5"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You grab a cricket from your cricket bag and feed it to Russell.  He coos appreciatively and nuzzles your hand.": {
      "pl": "Wyciągasz świerszcza z sakiewki na świerszcze i dajesz Russellowi. Burczy z zadowoleniem i ociera się o twoją dłoń.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_ravenconvo.cricket"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You hand him the puzzle and he starts fidgeting with it.": {
      "pl": "Podajesz mu układankę, a on zaraz zaczyna się z nią bawić.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_brother.bro1a",
        "data.json:scripts.cre_brother.puzz3"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You move the needle down to the cylinder and crank the handle a few times.": {
      "pl": "Opuszczasz iglicę na cylinder i kręcisz korbelem kilka razy.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_phonograph.e2"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You open your bedroom window (not pictured) and unlatch the door to Russell's cage.  He winks at you, caws one last time, then flies away to the West.": {
      "pl": "Otwierasz okno w sypialni (niewidoczne na ekranie) i otwierasz klatkę Russella. Mruga do ciebie, kracze po raz ostatni i odlatuje na Zachód.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_ravenconvo.release"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You pick up one of your brother's weird books and flip through it.": {
      "pl": "Bierzesz jedną z dziwnych książek brata i kartkujesz ją.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_brobookshelf.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You pull the needle away from the cylinder and stow the handle away.": {
      "pl": "Odsuwasz iglicę od cylindra i chowasz korbel.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_phonograph.e"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You read the spine of one of your books.": {
      "pl": "Czytasz okładkę jednej ze swoich książek.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_yourbooks.firstread"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You should give your brother Rufus his weird puzzle back.": {
      "pl": "Powinieneś oddać bratu Rufusowi jego dziwną układankę.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_starttut.talktorufus"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You shouldn't leave without at least saying goodbye to your dad.": {
      "pl": "Nie powinieneś wyjeżdżać, nie pożegnawszy się z tatą choćby krótko.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_starttut.talktodad"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You'll travel with Crazy Pete.": {
      "pl": "W drogę ruszysz z Szalonym Petem.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.takepete",
        "data.json:scripts.twilightzone_changepardner.takepete"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You'll travel with Doc Alice.": {
      "pl": "W drogę ruszysz z Doc Alice.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.takealice",
        "data.json:scripts.twilightzone_changepardner.takealice"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You'll travel with Gary the Goblin.": {
      "pl": "W drogę ruszysz z Gary'm Goblinem.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.takegary",
        "data.json:scripts.twilightzone_changepardner.takegary"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You'll travel with Susie Cochrane.": {
      "pl": "W drogę ruszysz z Susie Cochrane.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_skiptut.takesusie",
        "data.json:scripts.twilightzone_changepardner.takesusie"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You've read the papers, Rufus.  The people out West are in trouble.  They need all the help they can get.": {
      "pl": "Czytałeś gazety, Rufus. Ludzie na Zachodzie są w tarapatach. Potrzebują każdej pomocy, jaką dostaną.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_brother.bro2a"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Your brother Rufus is standing here looking nervous.  He's pretty good at looking nervous.": {
      "pl": "Brat Rufus stoi tu i wygląda na zdenerwowanego. Całkiem nieźle mu to wychodzi.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_brother.start"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Your father morosely jabs at the haystack.": {
      "pl": "Tata smutno dźga widły w stóg siana.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_dadconvo.start"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "your grandmother's brass knuckles": {
      "pl": "kastet twojej babci",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_dadconvo.leaving"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "your grandmother's briefcase full of snakes": {
      "pl": "teczka twojej babci pełna węży",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_dadconvo.leaving"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "your grandmother's favorite can of beans": {
      "pl": "ulubiona puszka fasoli twojej babci",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_dadconvo.leaving"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Your mom raises her eyebrow.": {
      "pl": "Mama unosi brew.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_mother.anotherhug"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Your mom smiles warmly as you approach.": {
      "pl": "Mama wita cię ciepłym uśmiechem.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.cre_mother.start"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    }
